# P8-4a-1 (owner decision I7): the protected engine, fairness and round sources, their build inputs,
# the trusted integrity manifest and the independent reference generator are LF in every checkout,
# whatever core.autocrlf says. The protected build output was verified to be line-ending
# independent (server/README.md §15); these rules keep the sources themselves reproducible.
/package.json                  text eol=lf
/src/engine/**                 text eol=lf
/src/shared/**                 text eol=lf
/src/seeded-round/**           text eol=lf
/src/fairness/**               text eol=lf
/server/engine/**              text eol=lf
/server/src/**                 text eol=lf
/server/scripts/**             text eol=lf
/server/integrity/**           text eol=lf
/server/test/independent/**    text eol=lf
/server/package.json           text eol=lf
/server/tsconfig.json          text eol=lf
/server/tsconfig.build.json    text eol=lf
